  "decision": "GO for fresh full qualification using the final pinned test sources; prior exploratory passes are supporting evidence, not a substitute.",
  "findings": [
    "TinyLeaf six-method suite checks repeated expansion sites, fresh locals, equal indices, source-order effectful actuals and old-slice snapshots, mutable private parameters, overlapping views, all11plain scalar widths, and wrapped narrow arithmetic. Native output goldens plus V8/Wasmtime run atO0/O2debug/release.",
    "TinyLeaf negative shapes cover globals, reference local, nested call, loop, branch, return, owning local and lexical capture. Instruction-boundary call decoding requires expansion only for eligible release cases; rejected/debug caller bodies match the reference byte-for-byte.",
    "Logical and physical faults use exported tick plus host-forged packed views, asserting both trapped status and retained prior store bytes. First-access failure, second-store failure after successful first store, duplicate-index writes and zero logical length are checked on both engines.",
    "Lane recurrence fixture includes zero/high-bit/255 bytes, every width4/8 remainder, exact physical-memory end, logical-short full physical storage, empty input, first-group and scalar-tail faults, live state aliasing and wrapping pointer fallback. Scalar oracle checks complete lane image and unmodified tail bytes.",
    "Boundary-decoded SIMD assertions require one unsigned8byte widening load plus low/high extensions for width8; width4 keeps its old single32bit load/byte-to-word-to-dword path. Existing typed-cast, callback, early-store, divide and debug-overflow exclusions retain ordered scalar behavior.",
    "TinyLeaf CLI defaults to current compiler and accepts optional matched reference; CI executes its meaningful default checks. Broad command77 explicitly supplies new exact TinyLeaf-disabled control. Lane tests also run standalone and through existing SIMD-only suite.",
    "Exploratory TinyLeaf6methodsPASS and hash lane/SIMD suitesPASS are retained. TinyLeaf final filename-uniqueness cleanup occurred afterward and is source-only so far; the final77gates will rerun those exact bytes. No broad or final-control PASS is inferred before execution."
  ],
  "coverage_limits": [
    "Private focused tests are finite examples; generic safety also relies on the reviewed closed whitelist and existing span/trap proof.",
    "No performance win is established by test success; current paired screen selection remains separate and final ten-workload delivery is pending."
  ],
